                              "args": {
                                "text": [
                                  "Rivet shows\nseparate branch\nvalves. A blocked\ndistrict can be\nisolated while the",
                                  "others keep\nservice. The\nbypass does not\ncreate more heat.\nIt gives the crew",
                                  "a way to make a\nrepair without\nmaking the whole\ncity wait outside."
                                ],
