                                    "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                                    "args": {
                                      "text": [
                                        "The public fund\nsets aside six\ntokens for basic\nservice: two for\nhomes, two for",
                                        "work sites, two\nfor shared rooms.\nIt has three more\nfor the first\nimprovements. One",
                                        "draft spends four\nextra tokens on a\ngrand hall and\nsilently takes one\nfrom the home",
                                        "baseline. Nib\nrejects that draft\nbefore anyone\nvotes. Preferences\nmay decide the",
                                        "extra three; they\nmust not remove\nthe common floor\neveryone agreed to\npreserve."
                                      ],
                                      "avatarId": "",
                                      "minHeight": 4,
